# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The production CSP whitelists the inline <script> in
# index.html by sha256 hash, and that hash is computed over the exact bytes —
# newlines included. A Windows checkout with CRLF produces a different digest
# than Vercel's Linux build, so a hash generated locally would be rejected in
# production and the script silently blocked. Pinning eol=lf makes the digest
# identical on every machine.
*           text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by newline conversion.
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.webp      binary
*.ico       binary
*.woff2     binary
*.gif       binary
*.pdf       binary
